  "description": "POQLUE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H48 F48 Gd4 N12 Ni2 O27,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a branched tree with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.862-3.912 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.83-109.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H54F48Gd4N12Ni2O29.",
